title: Negotiations with Right-Wing parties
new-page: true
is-card: true
card-image: img/zentrum.jpg
view-if: negotiation_z_timer = 0
on-arrival: negotiation_z_timer = 6; month_actions += 1
tags: parliamentary_affairs

= Negotiations with Right-Wing parties

<span style="color: #000000;">**Zentrum**</span> has been the leading bourgeoise party and our closest major ally throughout the republic, while the <span style="color: #3F7BC1;">**DNVP**</span> [? if kvp_formed: and the <span style="color: #455B95;">**KVP**</span> ?] remain our closest ideological allies. What should we do to strengthen out ties?

- @center: Strengthen our bonds with the Catholic Center Party.
- @kvp: Strengthen our bonds with the Conservative People's Party.
- @dnvp
- @convince_z_lautenbach: Convince <span style="color: #000000;">**Center Party**</span> to implement Lautenbach's Plan.
- @convince_z_lautenbach_wtb: Convince <span style="color: #000000;">**Center Party**</span> to implement Lautenbach-WTB Plan.
- @return: Perhaps we can discuss this at a later time.
- @easy_discard

@center
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; z_relation += 7*(1-dissent)

The Zentrum has been one of our closest allies through the course of the Republic.

@kvp
subtitle: -1 resources
view-if: kvp_formed = 1
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; kvp_relation += 5*(1-dissent)

The KVP is a moderate right wing party.

@dnvp
title: [? if dnvp_ideology = "Moderate" and not dnvp_leader = "Treviranus": Increase communications with the national-conservatives from DNVP. ?][? if dnvp_ideology = "Radical" and dvp_ideology = "Right": Collaborate with the anti-democratic rightists from DNVP. ?][? if dnvp_leader = "Treviranus" and dvp_ideology = "Right": Reconcile with the parliamentary turncoats from DNVP. ?][? if dnvp_ideology = "Radical" and dvp_ideology = "Left": Meet with the radical anti-republican rightists from DNVP. ?][? if dnvp_leader = "Treviranus" and dvp_ideology = "Left": Find common ground with the people's conservatives from DNVP. ?]
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; dnvp_relation += 5*(1-dissent)

[? if dnvp_ideology = "Radical" and dvp_ideology = "Right": Our mutual disdain for the Weimar Republic’s parliamentary catastrophe has made us natural allies with the radicalized DNVP. ?][? if dnvp_ideology = "Moderate" and not dnvp_leader = "Treviranus" and dvp_ideology = "Right": The DNVP’s reluctance to participate in the Reichstag under the moderates has made them a possible ally, despite our differences. ?][? if dnvp_leader = "Treviranus" and dvp_ideology = "Right": Ties with the DNVP have grown increasingly strained with our rapidly diverging views on the Republic, but negotiations are still possible with their nationalistic tendencies. ?][? if dnvp_ideology = "Radical" and dvp_ideology = "Left": Having the DNVP barrel towards rabid anti-parliamentarian tendencies has made any attempts of reconciliation increasingly moot. ?][? if dnvp_ideology = "Moderate" and not dnvp_leader = "Treviranus" and dvp_ideology = "Left": With the DNVP embracing a middle ground between the young parliamentarians and the radicals, perhaps we could find some compromise. ?][? if dnvp_leader = "Treviranus" and dvp_ideology = "Left": Having followed us in our more republican stance, the DNVP could be a great ally, should the SPD either be entirely excluded from government or embrace a radical rightward shift. ?]

@convince_z_lautenbach
subtitle: -2 budget.
unavailable-subtitle: -2 budget. [? if budget < 2 : We do not have the necessary budget. ?] [? if unemployed < 8 : Unemployment is low enough that job creation is not necessary. ?][? if inflation >= 5: The threat of inflation forces the Reichsbank to pause implementation of the plan. ?]
view-if: lautenbach_plan_adopted and (chancellor_party = "Z" or finance_minister_party = "Z" or economic_minister_party = "Z") and economic_policy_timer = 0
choose-if: budget >= 2 and unemployed >= 8 and inflation < 5
on-arrival: economic_policy_timer += 12; budget -= 2; lautenbach_plan_progress += 1; works_program += 1; unemployed -= 2 if unemployed >= 25; unemployed -= 1; inflation += 1; economic_growth += 1.6; workers_nsdap -= 2*(1-dissent); unemployed_nsdap -= 2*(1-dissent); workers_kpd -= 2*(1-dissent); unemployed_kpd -= 2*(1-dissent); workers_dvp += 1*(1-dissent); workers_z += 3*(1-dissent); new_middle_dvp += 3*(1-dissent); new_middle_z += 2*(1-dissent); old_middle_dvp += 3*(1-dissent); old_middle_z += 2*(1-dissent); rural_dvp += 1*(1-dissent); rural_z += 4*(1-dissent); pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent); z_relation += 3; ddp_relation += 2; spd_relation += 1;
achievement: wirtschaftspolitik

[? if lautenbach_plan_progress == 1 : We have convinced <span style="color: #000000;">**Center Party**</span> to implement the job-creation plan! Funds are sent to build public works projects across Germany, reducing unemployment. ?]

[? if lautenbach_plan_progress > 1 : We have convinced <span style="color: #000000;">**Center Party**</span> to continue to fund the job-creation plan, using our funds to build public works throughout Germany. ?]

[? if unemployed >= 10 : The Social Democrats approve of this plan as the "least bad" alternative, seeing it as necessary to save Germany's economy. ?]

[? if unemployed < 10 : Unemployment is low enough that the plan does not seem to have the intended effect. ?]

@convince_z_lautenbach_wtb
subtitle: -2 budget.
unavailable-subtitle: -2 budget. [? if budget < 2 : We do not have the necessary budget. ?][? if unemployed < 8 : Unemployment is low enough that job creation is not necessary. ?][? if inflation >= 5: The threat of inflation forces the Reichsbank to pause implementation of the plan. ?]
view-if: lautenbach_wtb_adopted and (chancellor_party = "Z" or finance_minister_party = "Z" or economic_minister_party = "Z") and economic_policy_timer = 0
choose-if: unemployed >= 10 and budget >= 2 and inflation < 5
on-arrival: economic_policy_timer += 12; lautenbach_wtb_progress += 1; works_program += 1; workers_spd += 4*(1-dissent); workers_dvp += 1*(1-dissent); workers_z += 1*(1-dissent); unemployed_spd += 6*(1-dissent); new_middle_dvp += 3*(1-dissent); new_middle_z += 1*(1-dissent); old_middle_dvp += 3*(1-dissent); old_middle_z += 1*(1-dissent); rural_dvp += 1*(1-dissent); rural_z += 3*(1-dissent); workers_nsdap -= 6; spd_relation += 3; z_relation += 3; ddp_relation += 3; kvp_relation += 3; dnvp_relation += 3 if dnvp_ideology = "Moderate"; coalition_dissent -= 1 if coalition_dissent >= 1; capital_strike_progress -= 1 if capital_strike_progress >= 3; dvp_left += 2; ddp_cohesion += 1; pro_republic += 5; unemployed -= 2 if unemployed >= 15; unemployed -= 2; inflation += 2; economic_growth += 2.6;
achievement: wirtschaftspolitik

[? if lautenbach_wtb_progress == 1 : We have convinced <span style="color: #000000;">**Center Party**</span> to implement the job-creation plan! Funds are sent to build public works projects across Germany, reducing unemployment. ?]

[? if lautenbach_wtb_progress > 1 : We have convinced <span style="color: #000000;">**Center Party**</span> to continue to fund the job-creation plan, using our funds to build public works throughout Germany. ?]
